TITLE Mix river water and seawater; set pe by O(0)/O(-2) couple
SOLUTION 1 River
    units mg/L
    pH 6.0
    Cl 10
    O(0) 1e-12
    pe 11.0 O(0)/O(-2)
SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    units mg/L
    pH 8.1
    Cl 19000
    O(0) 1e-12
    pe 11.0 O(0)/O(-2)
MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3
END
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_pe.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings pe
10 PUNCH PE
